^{T}=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 1 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\"." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040926/state.json" "file_sha256" "c01515fc00562e5e50184150fe5e9cf36bab5bc527378c28178084c47e6ee94b"} {"question" "q-74318" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040926/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "e19286e95f853a52e485f58892f46cde64ab59c39f32da645ff03f5e3084e006"} {"question" "q-74318" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040926/state.json" "file_sha256" "c01515fc00562e5e50184150fe5e9cf36bab5bc527378c28178084c47e6ee94b"} {"question" "q-74318" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "I and II only"] ["text" "I and III only"] ["text" "I only"] ["text" "II only"] ["text" "III only"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040926/state.json" "file_sha256" "c01515fc00562e5e50184150fe5e9cf36bab5bc527378c28178084c47e6ee94b"} {"question" "q-74318" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/text "I only"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040926/state.json" "file_sha256" "c01515fc00562e5e50184150fe5e9cf36bab5bc527378c28178084c47e6ee94b"} {"question" "q-68754" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Consider the matrix \n$A=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 & -7 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 8 \\\\ 7 & -8 & 1\\end{aligned}].$\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n- $A$ is upper triangular\n- $A$ is lower triangular\n- $A+{A}^{T}$ is upper triangular" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040926/state.json" "file_sha256" "c01515fc00562e5e50184150fe5e9cf36bab5bc527378c28178084c47e6ee94b"} {"question" "q-68754" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false, since $A$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 & -7 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 8 \\\\ 7 & -8 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false, since $A$ has non-zero entries above the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 & -7 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 8 \\\\ 7 & -8 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true, since the result of $A+{A}^{T}$ has all the entries below the main diagonal equal to zero:\n\n$$\nA+{A}^{T}=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only\"." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040926/state.json" "file_sha256" "c01515fc00562e5e50184150fe5e9cf36bab5bc527378c28178084c47e6ee94b"} {"question" "q-68754" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040926/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "e19286e95f853a52e485f58892f46cde64ab59c39f32da645ff03f5e3084e006"} {"question" "q-68754" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040926/state.json" "file_sha256" "c01515fc00562e5e50184150fe5e9cf36bab5bc527378c28178084c47e6ee94b"}